   "title": "Chronic diarrhea, pain, bleeding, weight loss: inflammatory bowel disease (IBD), and CROHN'S or ULCERATIVE COLITIS?",
   "lines": [
    "flares and remissions · peak 20s–30s, second peak 50s–70s · rule out INFECTION first (stool tests)",
    "colonoscopy + BIOPSY makes the diagnosis in both",
